Z||000001||Leadfoot||07-27-2001||02:54 PM||||Good luck! Shouldn't be half as hard as mine was, had to drill, cut and torch all my cradle bolts.  I used the info from V8 Archies website.  I used a cherry picker, 2 jack stands, a floor jack and a 8 ft long piece of 4x4.  I did the drop and install all by my lonesome and it took about a total of 2 days (what can I say I am slow).  If you need specifics I am more than willing to help you through it. Gods speed DreXteR!||||reg||1
